    "title": "Wellcare+",
    "description": "Wellcare+ is the mobile app all members need. Take your Medicare and Prescription Drug Plan ID cards with you on the go, find a provider, view claims, and stay connected.\r\n\r\nWellcare is designed to make Medicare easier. With Wellcare+, you\u2019ll always have your prescription coverage with you when you need it. You can stop carrying around insurance cards in your wallet, and you can quickly find a doctor or pharmacy in your network. \r\n\r\nWellcare+ is not currently available to former Allwell, Fidelis, Health Net, and Trillium Medicare members. We are working tirelessly to support those members with this app.",
